    <statement><p>The domain of <m>f(x,y)</m> is the <m>xy</m>-plane, and
values of <m>f</m> are given in the table below.</p>
<tabular bottom="medium" left="medium" right="medium" top="medium">
<row>
<cell><m>y\backslash x</m></cell>
<cell>0</cell>
<cell>1</cell>
<cell>2</cell>
<cell>3</cell>
<cell>4</cell>
</row>
<row>
<cell>0</cell>
<cell>55</cell>
<cell>56</cell>
<cell>57</cell>
<cell>56</cell>
<cell>56</cell>
</row>
<row>
<cell>1</cell>
<cell>56</cell>
<cell>56</cell>
<cell>56</cell>
<cell>56</cell>
<cell>58</cell>
</row>
<row>
<cell>2</cell>
